  "schema": "infini.vfx.slot_macros.v4_item_magnitude",
  "notes": [
    "Reusable slot fragments for Hybrid VFX Manifest. These are not semantic recipes: they are render/lifecycle morphs reused by many recipes.",
    "Recipes may reference a macro with {\"macro\": \"name\", ...overrides}. Explicit fields override macro fields.",
    "v0.3.24 introduced minQuality gates; v0.3.25 deprecates them as design gates because render quality is always Full.",
    "v0.3.25: minQuality remains only as deprecated compat; item-driven effectMagnitude + importance/visualCost/signatureWeight decide richness and emergency caps throttle overload."
